<view class="page"><view class="tip">速度只给图可管理员。拉条可改。默认：安卓小程序 150 / 3ms，苹果小程序 200 / 6ms；范围苹果 150–250 / 0–10ms，安卓 20–1024 / 0–3ms，App 和电脑 200–1024 / 0–10ms。保存后下次打印按拉条走。</view><view class="row pick" bindtap="onPickOutput"><view class="meta"><text class="lab">默认出纸</text><text class="hint">商家选「默认」时按这个出纸</text></view><text class="link">{{defaultOutput === 'text' ? '文本指令' : '位图'}}</text></view><view class="card" wx:for="{{platforms}}" wx:key="id"><text class="title">{{item.label}}</text><text class="hint">{{item.hint}}</text><text class="chunk">分包 {{item.chunkBytes}} 字节 · 间隔 {{item.intervalMs}}ms</text><text class="meta">分包 {{item.chunkMin}}–{{item.chunkMax}} 字节</text><slider class="slider" min="{{item.chunkMin}}" max="{{item.chunkMax}}" step="1" value="{{item.chunkBytes}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-key="chunkBytes" bindchanging="onPace" bindchange="onPace" activeColor="#1e4d8c" /><text class="meta">间隔 {{item.intervalMin}}–{{item.intervalMax}} ms（0=连续发）</text><slider class="slider" min="{{item.intervalMin}}" max="{{item.intervalMax}}" step="1" value="{{item.intervalMs}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-key="intervalMs" bindchanging="onPace" bindchange="onPace" activeColor="#546e7a" /></view><view class="save" bindtap="onSave"><image class="save-ico" src="/assets/icons/pe-save.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><text>保存</text></view><view class="sec">近 7 天失败率</view><view wx:if="{{!telemetry.length}}" class="empty">暂无遥测</view><view class="tel" wx:for="{{telemetry}}" wx:key="channel">{{item.label}} · {{item.platform}}　失败 {{item.failed}}/{{item.total}}　{{item.rate}}</view></view>
